        "en": "While a few patrons appreciate reasonable pricing for certain surgeries, multiple reviewers express significant frustration over unexpectedly high bills. Discontent centers on price quotes that increased before appointments, expensive diagnostic packages, and refusal to accept CareCredit at checkout."
      }
